' v1.2's location info on the world map (`MapScene.TryShowLocationInfo`;
' `preset classic|extended ai none seed 3 start 30`, at Paradise Camp). R
' shows INFO on the place he stands at. At the keyboard F shows the selected
' place's: Acid Town, a city, gives the city's report (`ShowCityReport`,
' `cityinfo.txt`: the camps around it he still lacks, the cities to hold).
' With the mouse a right click on a place tries the same before the menu
' (`View_OnContextMenu`): Acid Town's report again; on open ground the menu.
' In info mode a click on Acid Town gives the report as well.
press escape             ' Back closes the manual v1.2 opens on a new game's first world map (MapScene.cs:687-691)
wait 3
press r                  ' INFO on Paradise Camp
wait 5
press escape
wait 5
press left               ' the keyboard: Acid Town selected
wait 2
press f                  ' its report
wait 5
talkline 2               ' Okay
wait 5
menu 31,157              ' a right click on Acid Town: its report
wait 5
talkline 2
wait 5
menu 150,200             ' on open ground: the menu
wait 5
menuline 0               ' its INFO: info mode
wait 5
mapclick 31,157          ' Acid Town in info mode: its report
wait 5
talkline 2
wait 5
quit
